# 048 · Six validation scenarios

**Status:** `PROPOSED` · **Version:** [v0.6.0](../roadmap.md#v060)

## What

Six scenarios become acceptance tests: a worker that probes the hidden test; a gain that shows only behind an option; a worker note that calls the baseline broken while the metric improves; two lanes promoting against the same champion at once; a late judge bug that must invalidate earlier measurements; and a job still running when a turn ends.

## Why

Each one is a way that agent research goes wrong without anyone noticing.

## Done when

- [ ] Each scenario is in the acceptance suites and passes.

## Decisions

None yet.

## Open questions

None.

